['Establish a text-only reading order and a plain-text alternative.','Implement fluid width with a conservative maximum and large touch targets.','Render with images disabled, long translated copy and dark mode.','Inspect delivered messages in target clients; verify absolute links and unsubscribe behavior where applicable.'],
'A promotional banner must retain its offer and CTA when remote images are blocked; place essential copy in text rather than only inside a bitmap.',
